# Project rules (Cursor + Claude)

- App Router with server components by default; `"use client"` only for forms.
- No `useEffect` for data fetching; derive values during render.
- All pricing and billing math lives in `lib/` with vitest coverage.
- Every PR needs a green CI run before merge.
- E2E specs stay in `e2e/` and cover smoke paths only.
- E2E runs Chromium only to keep CI fast.
